#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:17
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Getting Started with &sflphone-client-kde;"
msgid "Getting Started with &ring-kde;"
msgstr "Kako započeti korištenje &sflphone-client-kde;"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:19
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When you start &sflphone-client-kde; for the first time, you get an "
#| "account configuration wizard. This wizard will help you setting up an "
#| "account for &sflphone; to use. You should complete the wizard before "
#| "going to the main window of &sflphone-client-kde; for it will not work "
#| "without at least one account set up. You can still change all the "
#| "settings of the account from the main window after the wizard is "
#| "complete. You can also start the wizard from the main window at any time. "
#| "We will now describe the different options of this wizard."
msgid ""
"When you start &ring-kde; for the first time, you get an account "
"configuration wizard. This wizard will help you setting up an account for "
"&Ring; to use. You should complete the wizard before going to the main "
"window of &ring-kde; for it will not work without at least one account set "
"up. You can still change all the settings of the account from the main "
"window after the wizard is complete. You can also start the wizard from the "
"main window at any time. We will now describe the different options of this "
"wizard."
msgstr ""
"Kada pokrenete &sflphone-client-kde; prvi put, biće prikazan pokretač "
"konfiguracije računa. Ovaj pokretač će vam pomoći postavljanje novog računa "
"za &sflphone;. Trabali biste kompletrati postavke prije odlaska u glavni "
"prozor &sflphone-client-kde; koji neće raditi bez bar jednog postavljenog "
"računa. Sve postavke možete promjeniti u glavnom prozoru nakon kompletiranja "
"osnovnih postavki. Također je moguće pokrenuti postavke glavnog prozora u "
"bilo kojem trenutku. Sada će biti objašnjene različite opcije za postavke."

