#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Welcoming page"
msgstr "Stranica dobrodošlice"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "The wizard introduction page"
msgstr "Početna stranica čarobnjaka"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can navigate in this wizard using the <guibutton>Next</guibutton>, "
"<guibutton>Previous</guibutton> and <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> buttons. "
"If you click on the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button, the wizard will "
"close without adding the account. Click on the <guibutton>Next</guibutton> "
"button to start configuring the account."
msgstr ""
"Kroz čarobnjak se možete kretati korištenjem <guibutton>Slijedeće</"
"guibutton>, <guibutton>Prethodno</guibutton> i <guibutton>Poništi</"
"guibutton> tipki. Ako pritisnete <guibutton>Poništi</guibutton> tipku, "
"čarobnjak će se zatvoriti bez spremanja računa. Pritisnite "
"<guibutton>Slijedeće</guibutton> tipku, da započnete konfiguraciju računa."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create or register"
msgstr "Kreiraj ili registruj"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "The registering type page"
msgstr "Stranica za registrovanje tipa"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:68
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can now choose to create a new account hosted by sflphone.org or "
#| "register an existing account that you own. If you use &sflphone; for the "
#| "first time and want to make things work the simplest way possible, you "
#| "should choose <guilabel>create a new account</guilabel>. It will create "
#| "an account and add it to &sflphone;. If you already have a SIP or IAX "
#| "account created with &sflphone; or by any other way, you can add it to "
#| "&sflphone; by choosing <guilabel>register an existing account</guilabel>."
msgid ""
"You can now choose to create a new account hosted by Ring.org or register an "
"existing account that you own. If you use &Ring; for the first time and want "
"to make things work the simplest way possible, you should choose "
"<guilabel>create a new account</guilabel>. It will create an account and add "
"it to &Ring;. If you already have a SIP or IAX account created with &Ring; "
"or by any other way, you can add it to &Ring; by choosing <guilabel>register "
"an existing account</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati kreiranje novog računa koji će biti smješten na sflphone.org "
"ili registrovati neki postoječi račun koji posjedujete. Ako koristite "
"&sflphone; prvi put i želite da stvari rade na najednostavniji mogući način, "
"trebate odabrati <guilabel>kreiaj novi račun</guilabel>. Ovo će kreirati "
"novi račun i dodati ga u &sflphone;. Ako imate SIP ili IAX račun kreiran sa "
"&sflphone; ili na neki drugi račun možete ga dodati u &sflphone; korištenjem "
"<guilabel>registruj postojeći račun</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new account"
msgstr "Kreiranje novog računa"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:78
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you choose to create an account on sflphone.org, the wizard will need "
#| "very few information to create the account, create it automatically and "
#| "add the information of the new account in &sflphone;. It creates a SIP "
#| "account, so you will then be able to use this new account from any other "
#| "system, with any software handling SIP accounts, using the information of "
#| "the new account that are displayed at the end of the process or reachable "
#| "from the main window."
msgid ""
"If you choose to create an account on Ring.org, the wizard will need very "
"few information to create the account, create it automatically and add the "
"information of the new account in &Ring;. It creates a SIP account, so you "
"will then be able to use this new account from any other system, with any "
"software handling SIP accounts, using the information of the new account "
"that are displayed at the end of the process or reachable from the main "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete kreiranje novog računa na sflphone.org, čarobnjak će "
"zahtijevati mali broj informacija za kreiranje, kreirati ga automatski i "
"dodati informacije za novi račun u &sflphone;. Ovo kreira i SIP račun, tako "
"da ćete moći koristiti novi račun sa bilo kojeg drugog sistema, sa bilo "
"kojim softverom koji radi sa SIP računima, korištenjem informacija novog "
"računa koje su prikazane na kraju procesa i dostupne u glavnom prozoru."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "Adresa e-pošte"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "The email address page"
msgstr "Stranica sa adresom e-pošte"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first information it will ask for is your email address. This is non-"
"obligatory, so you can just skip that step by clicking <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton> button. But it will enable you to receive some notifications "
"about the voice or text messages you receive while you are away."
msgstr ""
"Prvo će biti tražena adresa e-pošte. Ovo nije obavezno, tako da ga možete "
"preskočiti korištenjem <guibutton>Slijedeće</guibutton> tipke. Ali će vam "
"omogućiti da primate obavijesti o glasovnim i tekstualnim porukama."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Register an existing account"
msgstr "Registracija postojećeg računa"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:104
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have already created a SIP or IAX account with &sflphone; from "
#| "another computer or with another software, or if you want to use an "
#| "existing account, you can register it with this wizard to be able to use "
#| "it with this instance of &sflphone;. The wizard will ask you for the "
#| "basic information of this account in order to find it back. These "
#| "information are described in this section."
msgid ""
"If you have already created a SIP or IAX account with &Ring; from another "
"computer or with another software, or if you want to use an existing "
"account, you can register it with this wizard to be able to use it with this "
"instance of &Ring;. The wizard will ask you for the basic information of "
"this account in order to find it back. These information are described in "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste već kreiral SIP ili IAX račun sa &sflphone; sa drugog računara ili "
"softvera, ili ako želite koristiti postojeći račun, možete ga registrovati "
"korištenjem  čarobnjaka da biste ga mogli korisititi sa &sflphone;. "
"Čarobnjak će od vas tražiti osnovne informacije o računu u cilju njegovog "
"pronalaženja. Ove informacije su opisane u ovom dijelu."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "SIP or IAX"
msgstr "SIP ili IAX"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "The account type page"
msgstr "Stranica sa tipom računa"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:122
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&sflphone; handles two protocols for calls, SIP and IAX2. The wizard will "
#| "now ask you which of those is your account. If you already have an "
#| "account created, just choose the right type. If you want to create one "
#| "without &sflphone; and you wonder which type to choose, you can refer to "
#| "<ulink url=\"http://www.voip-info.org/wiki/view/IAX+versus+SIP\">this "
#| "document</ulink> to know which one fits your needs best."
msgid ""
"&Ring; handles two protocols for calls, SIP and IAX2. The wizard will now "
"ask you which of those is your account. If you already have an account "
"created, just choose the right type. If you want to create one without "
"&Ring; and you wonder which type to choose, you can refer to <ulink url="
"\"http://www.voip-info.org/wiki/view/IAX+versus+SIP\">this document</ulink> "
"to know which one fits your needs best."
msgstr ""
"&sflphone; koristi dva protokola za pozive, SIP i IAX2. Čarobnjak će vas "
"sada pitati koji od tih je vaš račun.Ako već imate kreiran račun, samo "
"odaberite pravi tip. Ako želite kreirati račun bez &sflphone; i pitate se "
"koji ti izabrati možete pogledati <ulink url=\"http://www.voip-info.org/wiki/"
"view/IAX+versus+SIP\">ovaj dokument</ulink> da saznate koji vam tip najbolje "
"odgovara."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account settings"
msgstr "Podešavanja računa"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "The settings page"
msgstr "Stranica sa podešavanjima"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:140
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The wizard needs a few information to find your account. The alias is for "
#| "convenience only, you can choose anyone. It will be applied only on "
#| "&sflphone; on this system, not in the account. Server is the one that "
#| "hosts your account. User is the username of the account. Unlike the "
#| "alias, it has to be the username chosen while creating the account. "
#| "Password is also the one chosen for the account. Mailbox number will be "
#| "used by the mailbox button to keep you from having to type that number "
#| "too often. Usually it is 888."
msgid ""
"The wizard needs a few information to find your account. The alias is for "
"convenience only, you can choose anyone. It will be applied only on &Ring; "
"on this system, not in the account. Server is the one that hosts your "
"account. User is the username of the account. Unlike the alias, it has to be "
"the username chosen while creating the account. Password is also the one "
"chosen for the account. Mailbox number will be used by the mailbox button to "
"keep you from having to type that number too often. Usually it is 888."
msgstr ""
"Čarobnjak  treba nekoliko informacija da pronađe vaš račun. Nadimak  je samo "
"za provjeru, izaberite bilo koji. Biće primjenjen jedino na &sflphone; na "
"datom sistemu, ne u računu. Server upravlja vašim računom. Korisnik je "
"korisničko ime računa. Za razliku od nadimka korisničko ime mora biti "
"odabrano pri kreiranju računa. Šifra je ista kao i za račun. Poštanski broj "
"će biti korišten sa tipkom pošte da ga ne biste morali unositin previše "
"često. Obično je to 888."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "STUN settings"
msgstr "STUN postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "The STUN page"
msgstr "STUN stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:160
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you register a SIP account or create it on sflphone.org (that also "
#| "means registering a SIP account after all), the wizard proposes you to "
#| "enable STUN. You may want to do it if you are connected under a firewall. "
#| "Actually, this is not an option of this account in particular, but of the "
#| "&sflphone; configuration; it will be applied for any account. If you "
#| "enable this option, you have to choose the STUN server you want to use "
#| "(&eg;: stunserver.org)."
msgid ""
"If you register a SIP account or create it on Ring.org (that also means "
"registering a SIP account after all), the wizard proposes you to enable "
"STUN. You may want to do it if you are connected under a firewall. Actually, "
"this is not an option of this account in particular, but of the &Ring; "
"configuration; it will be applied for any account. If you enable this "
"option, you have to choose the STUN server you want to use (&eg;: stunserver."
"org)."
msgstr ""
"Ako registrujete SIP račun ili ga kreirate na sflphone.org (to znači "
"registraciju SIP računa poslije svega), čarobnjak vam predlaže da omogućite "
"STUN. To možete uraditi ako ste spojeni preko firewal-a. Zapravo ovo nije "
"opcija za  samo ovaj račun, već za &sflphone; konfiguraciju; biće primjenjen "
"za bilo koji račun. Ako omogućite ovu opciju, morate odabrati STUN server "
"koji želite koristiti (&eg;: stunserver.org)."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "The conclusion page"
msgstr "Stranica sa zaključkom"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "The final page"
msgstr "Posljednja stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The conclusion page resumes the information you have sent during the wizard "
"process. It has not done anything yet so you can still give up clicking "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button. If you click on <guibutton>Finish</"
"guibutton>, it will send all the information and create the account if you "
"chose to create it or register it if you were registering an existing "
"account. As it has not sent the information at this step, it cannot know if "
"the registration will succeed. To check this, once you are in the main "
"window, go to the account settings page to see the state of your accounts."
msgstr ""
"Stranica sa zaključkom sumira informacije koje ste poslali tokom procesa sa "
"čarobnjakom. Ništa još nije urađeno tako da možete odustati od svega "
"pritiskom <guibutton>Poništi</guibutton> tipke. Ako pritisnite "
"<guibutton>Završi</guibutton>, sve informacije će biti poslane i kreiran "
"novi račun ako ste izabrali da ga kreirate ili registrovan postojeći ako ste "
"izabrali registraciju. Kako u ovom koraku informacije nisu poslane ne može "
"znati da li će registracija uspjeti. Da provjerite ovo kada ste u glavnom "
"prozoru idite na postavke računa i vidite status vašeg računa."
